{'symbol': 'APA', 'date': '2021-10-14 12:34:00', 'title': 'APACHE CORPORATION DONATES MORE THAN 55,000 TREES TO 66 NONPROFIT ORGANIZATIONS', 'text': "HOUSTON, OCT. 14, 2021 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- APACHE CORPORATION, A SUBSIDIARY OF APA CORPORATION (NASDAQ: APA), TODAY ANNOUNCED THE DONATION OF MORE THAN 55,000 TREES TO 66 NONPROFIT PARTNER ORGANIZATIONS THROUGH THE ANNUAL APACHE CORPORATION TREE GRANT PROGRAM. SINCE 2005, APPROXIMATELY 4.8 MILLION TREES HAVE BEEN GRANTED TO OVER 900 NON-PROFIT CHARITABLE PARTNERS AND GOVERNMENT AGENCIES IN THE U.S. PLANTINGS FROM THIS YEAR'S GRANTS WILL BEGIN THIS MONTH AND WILL CONTINUE THROUGH MAY 2022."}